          "proposition": {
            "text": "Gangacharan Mukherjee and A. N. Sinha for the respondents. 1952. October 23. The judgment of the Court was delivered by BHAGWATI J, 110 BHAGWATI J.-The question that arises for our consideration in this appeal is whether prior to the enactment of section 65-A of the Transfer of Property Act in 1929 a mortgagor in possession had the power to grant a permanent lease of the mortgaged property so as to bind the mortgagee.",
